// ══ v667 — ONE CANONICAL JAPANESE SPEECH STYLE ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
// The three dashboard choices map deterministically to the three JAPANESE_REGISTER_RULES ids:
//   POLITE (です・ます) → 'polite' · NATURAL (Friendly everyday Japanese) → 'natural' · VERY CASUAL (Slang & close-friend
//   speech) → 'casual' (shown as very_casual in logs). Every other spelling (very_casual, friendly, default, normal …)
//   is an explicit alias — never a separate interpretation.
