    // Must contain target word — only A's lines, B's response doesn't need it
    // PAIR-LEVEL. A reply line need not repeat the target; the exchange as a whole
    // must use it. Checking each line separately produced "target missing" on
    // perfectly good A lines whose B reply lacked the word.
