  // generation calls validateSmartPairs with strict=false — so in practice the gate
  // never ran during generation at all. That is how 26 untaught words reached the
  // 11 Sept track.
  // PRECISE CLOSED-VOCABULARY CHECK. Requiring full character coverage was too
