// ══ v668 §13–§16 — THE INTENT SKELETON: turn intents planned (and validated) BEFORE any surface language ══
// QUESTION → ANSWER · PROPOSAL → ACCEPT / REJECT / COUNTERPROPOSAL · STATEMENT → REACTION · REQUEST → RESPONSE ·
// CHOICE → SELECTION · GREETING → GREETING · FAREWELL → FAREWELL. Targets are planned 1 per turn (never 4).
