// ══ v668 §17–§26/§38 — SCENE PREFLIGHT: the candidate stays a CANDIDATE until this deterministic check decides
// COMMIT (clean), REPAIR (isolated residual defects → positive-palette atomic repair) or REGENERATE (fundamentally
// invalid → the SAME scene again: same targets, premise, skeleton and palette, stronger constraints).
const LISTENING_REPAIR_CALL_TARGET = 10       // v668 §50: health telemetry target, never a gate
const LISTENING_REASSIGN_CALLS = 4            // v668: paid placement calls for reassigned targets, per track
