    la.speakerContract + extra + '\nEach new line keeps its speaker and its job in the conversation (a question stays a question, a reply stays a reply), at most ' + LISTENING_MAX_TARGETS_PER_TURN + ' lesson words per line, natural spoken ' + la.label + '.\n' +
    (env.ctx && env.ctx.complexity ? 'EVERY returned line (learner belt ' + env.ctx.complexity.belt + '): ' + env.ctx.complexity.repairRule + '. Shorter is fine. If meaning does not fit, DROP detail or simplify the idea — never cram it in. ' +
      'Rewrite using ONLY the ALLOWED CONTENT words (plus the grammar / function words); if the meaning does not fit those words, choose a simpler idea that does. A more natural line with an unlisted word is still rejected.\n' : '') + '\n' +
    blocks.join('\n\n') + '\n\nReply ONLY with compact JSON: {"repairs":[{"issueId":"i1","lines":[{"lineId":"L17","text":"...","english":"..."}]}]}'
